# Probabimals Cursor Rules

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `.codex/project-context.md`, and `knowledge/HOW_TO_RUN.md` before planning substantial changes.
- Prefer `make validate` before handing off completed work.
- Use focused checks while iterating: `make test`, `make static-check`, `make lint`, `make format-check`, `make typecheck`, and `make security`.
- Use `make build` for cache-safe Web Dev export checks when export behavior is relevant.
- Keep gameplay parameters in `resources/data/*.json` when the value is design-tunable.
- Avoid broad edits in `addons/`, `build/`, `.godot/`, and `.godot-home/`.
- Preserve the Godot signal-driven architecture described in `knowledge/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
